at|^j TABLE OF CONTENTS|fp||

ht|n|at|^*GA1,1.  Letting the opponents play in their 8-card fit at the 2 level in a competitive auction is not winning bridge^*N|
                  
ht|o|at|^*GA2,2.  2nd seat is the most risky seat in which to preempt^*N|
                  
ht|p|at|^*GA3,3.  In general, stretch for games in IMPs^*N|
                  
ht|q|at|^*GA4,4.  Strain to bid 2@C over 1@D whenever you can^*N|
                  
ht|r|at|^*GA5,5.  The beauties of preempting^*N|
                  
ht|s|at|^*GA6,    ^*N|


ht|y|cp||fp||AT|^bRelease date: April 28, 2024.  Please click the  Flow  button or any blue link to begin.|
