mb|1D|mb|P|mb|1S|mb|D|mb|2s|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|North should redouble. 2@S promises 4 spades. Redouble is a support redouble (a good convention), is a support redouble showing exactly 3 spades. Support doubles come up a lot while support redoubles are rarer. Let us undo your bid.|
