mb|R|mb|2H|mb|2S|nt|^z@3^b@2^^|mb|P|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Generally speaking letting the opponents play in their 8 card fit at the 2 level in a competitive auction is not winning bridge. Here is the one case where you should bid "3 over 2" even with an 8 card fit--bidding 3@H.|
