up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|In 3@H they lose 1 spade, 1 or 2 hearts depending on how the suit is played, 1 club, and 1 diamond for either making or down 1. In IMPs I am guessing we will win around 3 IMPs. In Match Points I am guessing because we made 4. It is a nice average plus board, probably worth around 80% of the Match Points.|
PG| ***** 20 ***** |


