mb|P|mb|1S|mb|P|mb|2N|mb|P|mb|?|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Many players would pass with my hand since we have at most 19 + 6 = 25 HCP. However, I do not like passing 2N invitational. It is only right, particularly in IMPs if you make 2N exactly. It is wrong if you make 3N. And it is wrong if you can't make 2N as 3N is only one extra undertrick.|
PG| ***** 47 ***** |


nt|^z@3^b@2^^|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|The upside of making 3N is great. So I am going to bid a speculative 3N particularly since I have 2 kings and a diamond fit. Of course here it is going to take a lot of luck to make 3N.|
PG| ***** 48 ***** |


