up|52|cp|8|AT|^B@2^*Bhondo717: ^*N|cp||at|Please notice my 3N bid only cost us an undertrick that is almost irrelevant in IMPs. Perhaps a little more costly in Match Points. In general, stretch for games in IMPs but do not bid close games in Match Points.|
